public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nHarden outbound connection handling in the LLM Chat MCP client.\r\n\r\n- The LLM Chat MCP client now validates the server URL on each connection with `resolve_pinned_target()`. The streamable HTTP and SSE transports get an isolated client that dials only the validated addresses. This is the same pattern that the gateway, A2A, and tool services use.\r\n- The pinned client does not follow redirects.\r\n- The default client in `streamable_http_compat.streamable_http_client()` no longer follows redirects.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- `mcpgateway/services/mcp_client_chat_service.py`: `_build_transport()` is now async. It resolves a `PinnedTarget` for HTTP transports and passes `httpx_client_factory` to `streamable_http_client()` and `sse_client()`. The stdio path does not change.\r\n- `mcpgateway/utils/streamable_http_compat.py`: the default client uses `follow_redirects=False`.\r\n- Tests for the pinned client factory, the unpinned fallback, validation failure, and the dial address on both HTTP transports.\r\n\r\ninternal issue: https://github.ibm.com/contextforge-org/internal_issues/issues/1245","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-23T09:48:19Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:12:48Z","closed_at":"2026-11-23T13:12:46Z","merged_at":"2026-11-23T13:12:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"a1c3293b4657140cd801ecc4873a96919ed7dd95","assignee":{"login":"msureshkumar88","id":3370125,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzAxMjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3370125?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msureshkumar88","html_url":"https://github.com/msureshkumar88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msureshkumar88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msureshkumar88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msureshkumar88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msureshkumar88/starred{/owner}{/repo}"